      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Regions Mode & Photo Edit Guide",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Unified Layout in Regions Mode (Krea 2)\n\nWorks out of the box from scratch \u2014 or drop a photo in to edit:\n\n- **Visual references & LoRAs**: drag images straight onto a box or Mixin in **Layout**, and bind per-character or per-box LoRAs.\n- **Photo editing + SAM3**: wire a `LoadImage` into **Layout Inputs**' `image`, pick a SAM3 checkpoint if you want wand/capture segmentation, and enable `edit_image` on **Layout Apply**.\n- **Agent**: `Layout Inputs`' `clip` lets the Layout editor's AI agent propose or refine boxes using your loaded Qwen3-VL encoder.\n- **Switch modes any time**: flip `Regions` -> `MOSS-Image` / `Ideogram 4` / `FLUX 3 Klein` without losing boxes, mixins, refs or LoRAs."
      ]
    }
